---
title: "The board"
---

We are organised as a small democracy. The Board (Consiglio Direttivo) is the governing body of the Group. It is made up of two Honorary Councillors and 15 elected Councillors, from whom the four officers are chosen. It meets about once a month, and proposes and organises the activities during the year. It takes on the proposals of the annual General Meeting and any proposals from individual members. It remains in office for three years, after which new elections are called.

**PRESIDENT:** Fernando Bellotti

**VICE PRESIDENT:** Alessandro Boni

**TREASURER:** Gianluigi Savoldi

**SECRETARY:** Mariateresa Pedrini

**COUNCILLORS:** Sara Brena, Luigi Cappelli, Luigi Carminati, Enrico Corna, Marco Daldossi, Mauro Fogaccia, Mirko Magri, Maria Grazia Morosini, Mario Pagliaroli, Gianluca Paravisi, Anna Signori

